 The LiDAR implementation is ready for its first iPhone test on commit 0cb00fa. It is not merged into main, and it has not yet been compiled on a 
  Mac or tested on a physical iPhone.

  Important limitation: the current flow still requires a supported car part before it unlocks LiDAR. It cannot yet start with an arbitrary object.
  A direct “Scan any object” mode still needs to be added.

  ## Test the current car-part flow                                                                                                                
                                                                                                                                                   
  First, publish the independent branch from the computer that contains the worktree:                                                              
                                                                                                                                                   
  git -C /tmp/car_parts-ios-lidar push -u origin feature/ios-lidar-capture
                                                                                                                                                   
  On the MacBook:                                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                   
  git clone https://github.com/BrennanOwYong/car_parts.git                                                                                         
  cd car_parts                                                                                                                                     
  git switch feature/ios-lidar-capture                                                                                                             
  cp .env.example .env                                                                                                                             
  open CarPartCAD.xcodeproj
                                                                                                                                                   
  Put your OpenAI key in .env.                                                                                                                     
                                                                                                                                                   
  Find the Mac Wi-Fi address:                                                                                                                      
                                                                                                                                                   
  ipconfig getifaddr en0                                                                                                                           

  Start the relay. Replace the example address:                                                                                                    
                                                                                                                                                   
  ASTRA_RELAY_HOST=192.168.1.20 ./astra_relay.py
                                                                                                                                                   
  On the iPhone, open:                                                                                                                             
                                                                                                                                                   
  http://192.168.1.20:8787/health                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                   
  Continue when it shows:                                                                                                                          
                                                                                                                                                   
  {"status":"ok"}                                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                   
  In Xcode:                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                   
  1. Select the CarPartCAD target.                                                                                                                 
  2. Open Signing & Capabilities.                                                                                                                  
  3. Select your Apple Developer team.                                                                                                             
  4. Set a unique bundle identifier if required.                                                                                                   
  5. Connect the iPhone by cable.                                                                                                                  
  6. Enable Settings → Privacy & Security → Developer Mode.                                                                                        
  7. Select the physical iPhone as the run destination.                                                                                            
  8. Select Product → Run.                                                                                                                         

  Apple requires a physical device to test hardware-specific features such as LiDAR. The simulator cannot perform this test. See Apple’s           
  physical-device instructions (https://developer.apple.com/documentation/xcode/building-and-running-an-app) and ARKit scene reconstruction        
  (https://developer.apple.com/documentation/ARKit/ARWorldTrackingConfiguration/sceneReconstruction).                                              

  In the app:                                                                                                                                      

  1. Open Relay.                                                                                                                                   
  2. Enter http://192.168.1.20:8787.                                                                                                               
  3. Upload or take a car-part photo.                                                                                                              
  4. Confirm Astra’s vehicle and part result.                                                                                                      
  5. Wait for OEM and public-scan searches.                                                                                                        
  6. If Astra returns needs_lidar, select Start final LiDAR scan.                                                                                  
  7. Move around all accessible sides until the green mesh covers the object.                                                                      
  8. Mark a screw hole, clip, tab, edge, and opening.                                                                                              
  9. Select Use metric scan for CAD.                                                                                                               
  10. Share the fitted and exploded .scad files.                                                                                                   
                                                                                                                                                   
  LiDAR can miss small holes and thin edges. Verify important distances with a ruler or caliper.                                                   
                                                                                                                                                   
  ## Consolidated questions and answers                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                   
  Can I test LiDAR now?                                                                                                                            

  Yes, as a first unverified physical-device test. The feature branch has 10 of 11 gates complete. The remaining gate is your real-iPhone test.    
                                                                                                                                                   
  Can it scan any object?                                                                                                                          
                                                                                                                                                   
  Not through the complete workflow yet. The current app only unlocks LiDAR after the car-part source search fails.                                
                                                                                                                                                   
  What is needed for arbitrary objects?                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                   
  Add a direct Scan object mode. It must bypass vehicle identification and OEM research, capture the object from all accessible angles, and send   
  the metric mesh directly to lidar_generate.                                                                                                      
                                             
